  "content": "\n\n<main class=\"min-h-[calc(100vh-4.5rem-310.59px)]\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Совместимый мод/датапак для&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftowns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a>, обеспечивающий корректную генерацию структур в&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbig-globe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Big Globe</a></p>\n<p>Если вы не можете найти структуру через /locate, рекомендую использовать мод (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexplorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explorer Compass</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/401602e131bff6dd98db085149f45b54ca7cce11_0.webp\" alt=\"a\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b6c2b9ca45585484c6a8150860689d583109f43_0.webp\" alt=\"b\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7171512092864acf73846f935b5ec78f74f00d2c_0.webp\" alt=\"c\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main><footer class=\"footer-brand-background experimental-styles-within border-0 border-t-[1px] border-solid\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>",
